WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:08.521
"You're mean, Zippy," said Dipper.

2
00:00:08.522 --> 00:00:11.828
"Eddy is fast," said Jeb.

3
00:00:11.829 --> 00:00:16.376
"He won our race," said Poppy.

4
00:00:16.377 --> 00:00:20.382
"Eddy is not fast," said Zippy.

5
00:00:20.383 --> 00:00:26.718
"He won because you're all slow!"

6
00:00:26.719 --> 00:00:29.459
Eddy felt sad.

7
00:00:29.460 --> 00:00:32.708
"I'm fast!" said Zippy.

8
00:00:32.709 --> 00:00:35.886
He zoomed off.

9
00:00:35.887 --> 00:00:39.868
Vroom! Vroom!

10
00:00:39.869 --> 00:00:42.304
Zippy turned left.

11
00:00:42.305 --> 00:00:44.583
He turned right.

12
00:00:44.584 --> 00:00:58.310
"Wow," thought Eddy.

13
00:00:58.311 --> 00:01:01.526
Crash!

14
00:01:01.527 --> 00:01:08.596
Zippy hit a wall.

15
00:01:08.597 --> 00:01:12.092
Something rolled across the lot.

16
00:01:12.093 --> 00:01:15.298
"My wheel!" cried Zippy.

17
00:01:15.299 --> 00:01:17.995
"I can't drive now!"

18
00:01:17.996 --> 00:01:25.296
Zippy looked sad.

19
00:01:25.297 --> 00:01:29.099
"I'll help," said Eddy.

20
00:01:29.100 --> 00:01:36.296
"Me too," said Jeb.

21
00:01:36.297 --> 00:01:39.055
Jeb picked up Zippy's wheel.

22
00:01:39.056 --> 00:01:41.214
He put it in Eddy's dumper.

23
00:01:41.215 --> 00:01:53.054
Eddy carried the wheel to Zippy.

24
00:01:53.055 --> 00:01:56.978
"Thanks," said Zippy.

25
00:01:56.979 --> 00:02:01.314
"Eddy, let's race again!" called Poppy.

26
00:02:01.315 --> 00:02:03.012
Eddy smiled.

27
00:02:03.013 --> 00:02:06.547
Zippy was mean.

28
00:02:06.548 --> 00:02:14.447
But Eddy had three new friends!

